	(text "LED STICK (J12): off-board DIYmall 8 x WS2812B on the case's top edge, short cable.\nGPIO18 (PIO) -> U14 74AHCT1G125 (TTL in, 5 V out: WS2812B needs VIH 3.5 V) -> R80 330 R -> DIN.\nPower from VCC (5 V buck, shared with the IO ports): up to about 0.5 A at full white. Cap brightness in firmware."
